{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "b692d1b90239c1899bda9aa7ee06b5e835ad938d02c7b426f98d35acee51cb5a", "ja": "選択の自由を", "zh": "选择的自由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f8905b74a4aa0df657aa8913d67c513a81a3e0552830e3849ace013381fa154a", "ja": "ハッピーな番外編が完成したものの、他の\n役と絡む事が出来ないと莉緒は寂しがる。\n皆が悩む中、プロデューサーが関係各所に\n相談した結果、朗読劇は2本ともイベントで\n上演する事になるのだった。", "zh": "虽然快乐的番外篇完成了，但因为无法和其他角色互动，莉绪感到有些寂寞。  \n在大家烦恼之际，制作人向相关各方进行了商量，结果朗读剧的2本作品都将在活动中上演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "a08ae61fd2896a2aaaa570fe2d7aa4abee69d8565b79db7d5c4ae47fb203a147", "ja": "あら？　ねえ、ちょっと……。\n私だけ、みんなとちっとも絡んでなくな～い！？", "zh": "哎呀？我说，等一下……\n是不是只有我完全没跟其他人搭上戏啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "c49c7dbbf4ac0ca2478d61abf26b331272814d48d8de9f03c320596e0d9acab4", "ja": "言われてみれば、そうですわね。", "zh": "您这么一说，确实如此呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "e33c6ad396abbc5b1ce89114034a08c4cc73a5f7e78a846b21883951d22913c3", "ja": "莉緒さんが演じるエレオノーラは、\n本編でお亡くなりになっていますからね～。", "zh": "莉緒扮演的艾莱奥诺拉，在正篇里已经去世了呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "788e36e3b753b42b0dc409a5ac2b78efeb5b87f7cc464cbff5a5a86435ec5c6b", "ja": "そうなんだ。だから続編があったとしても、\n出番は回想シーン中心なんだろうけど……。", "zh": "原来如此。所以就算有续集，她的戏份应该也会以回忆场景为主吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cbc1539d5bf7a204e4e962c9b63b4f4fa622363640cedc19da7145ca7c41b859", "ja": "今回は夜想令嬢、ユニットのファンイベントだから、\n莉緒を入れて話を作ってもらったんだ。", "zh": "因为这次是夜想令嬢的组合粉丝活动，所以就请他们把莉绪也安排进来编了个故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "36704de5b22e8e91475acbc7b416ee99344964fb60ca49aa40aa57029697e301", "ja": "昴はSHADE OF SPADEのツアー中で、\n今回は出られないしな。", "zh": "昴正在进行SHADE OF SPADE的巡演，这次没办法参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "700bd370f6c5e9b4ef2ab64c263b5e3f07bb0064c485cf8490fadd26cecaf941", "ja": "天国で、旦那さんとアンジェラが一緒なんでしょ？\nそれじゃダメなの？", "zh": "在天国，她丈夫不是和安洁拉在一起吗？\n那样不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "8410a4961686a52b437d9f6b4b113dee77525c340454d00be10deb5638f621a3", "ja": "いーやーよー！\nみんなとの絡みもほしいの、私は！", "zh": "才——不——要——呢！\n我还想和大家多有互动嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "adff47936d35e2c9bc647c62a45300bea0f515d9b2fb0f01781657437605935e", "ja": "困りましたね～。それですと、やはり\n最初にもらった脚本ということに……。", "zh": "真让人为难呢～。那样的话，果然\n还是得用最开始拿到的剧本了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "36f701b6d0d67ccfc0a72b9b32489cbe617fa6ab0f45ccef227b7b27fb293069", "ja": "え～っ！", "zh": "诶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "36f701b6d0d67ccfc0a72b9b32489cbe617fa6ab0f45ccef227b7b27fb293069", "ja": "え～っ！", "zh": "诶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "711c0b592c7b31f4b24728d89eb2baa047d0b3e68d64081f41bf5220f9f3547b", "ja": "まあまあ、ふたりとも落ち着いてくださいまし。\n{$P$}、どうしましょう？", "zh": "好啦好啦，你们两位都冷静一下吧。\n{$P$}先生，怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ff37e003a795869e50ae5df73fd607a7b31ba8787014165d50bcdd468400010", "ja": "わたくしは、みんなで考えたハッピーエンドな\n番外編も、楽しくて良いと思いますけれど……。", "zh": "我觉得大家一起构思一个开心结局的番外篇，也挺有意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "454fd78bf8063db4f50f5198549f016a0b4d17bcecb61070447078ce5e0beeb7", "ja": "うーん、そうですね。\nかなりはっちゃけた内容ですけど……。", "zh": "嗯——是啊。\n内容确实挺放飞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6cf2993392c0f7a227fb58c6d0dbd2fbe00a8682aec584013ea73e5d6c061b9f", "ja": "まずは番外編が可能かどうか、\n脚本家さんや社長に相談してみます。", "zh": "我先去和编剧还有社长商量一下，看看能不能做番外篇。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1015_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "063ee08f428aa229bda54feeebd678449c8330ee8207d752cb54926e730e8ee3", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。この前の番外編について、\n関係各所に相談してみたんだけど……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。关于之前的番外篇，我找相关方面商量了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4c0c3af8c93ed68493abb6d26235d4a2ea93ae1c829e5ba645f426c2c7790268", "ja": "朗読劇は、元々の続編と、みんなの考えた番外編。\n2本とも上演しよう、という事になった！", "zh": "朗读剧的话，原本的续集，还有大家想出来的番外篇，2部都要上演——就这么定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "f943249266d23b65bd6df5c3066e81e054bf4cc00cfa518ba6582aa724baa404", "ja": "ええっ！　自分で言っておいてなんだけど……\n本当にいいの？　{$P$}くん。", "zh": "诶诶！虽然是我自己提出来的……  \n真的可以吗？{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fa2078f32207d830d7bda9f07603d17cee335e7e8bd82924671a70ddd7a4ebd2", "ja": "ああ。社長に相談したら、「幸せな登場人物たちが\n見たいお客さんもいるだろう」という事で……。", "zh": "啊。我去找社长商量后，他说：“应该也有想看幸福的登场人物的观众吧”，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ac9de7b63120933e594331e1e6381355312cfa3392e1e67c7b04e2dcbafbd053", "ja": "脚本家さんも、「本編の流れでは色々難しいので、\n番外編で思いっきり幸せにしてください！」だそうだ。", "zh": "编剧先生也说了：“按正篇的发展，有些地方实在很难处理，所以请在番外篇里让他们尽情幸福吧！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "c2905623e8a3a7cb9a0af06a16de8356f67278a36edace725ffd626923f9870a", "ja": "まぁ……！　理解が得られて、良かったですわ。\nきっとファンの方々も、喜んでくださいます。", "zh": "哎呀……！能得到理解真是太好了。\n粉丝们肯定也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "2d63a6a292c2adfe42f38f93a89346aa8301d291a7cd3af10ce335fa946ebb52", "ja": "本来の続編に、幸せな番外編……\nいいとこ取りができますね～♪", "zh": "原本续篇，再加上幸福的番外篇……\n可以把优点全都收入囊中呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "3908280dde0c66e49cc0c6b4d8d6238ab77cc5a4beaee77da2914fa7581ab43d", "ja": "ん～っ♪\nファンイベント、ますます楽しみになってきた！", "zh": "嗯～♪\n越来越期待粉丝活动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "a988c68200b5a4ef4885a4daccd534715908090161054cf52191111e2f1e05b7", "ja": "ええ！\nはりきって練習するわよ～っ！", "zh": "当然！\n我们要鼓起干劲好好练习啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1025_null", "source_sha256": "6902d2c02f5e6bd5348fc85f322276ef074d1cbe8f051eabd58a048eb6a992f3", "ja": "そして、イベント当日――", "zh": "然后，到了活动当天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "26fa98f40c80593c91676e17e0088726a075c80b23d149f226293e3c734885eb", "ja": "それでは、次は朗読劇のコーナーです！\nなんと、スペシャルゲストもいるんだよ～！", "zh": "接下来是朗读剧环节！\n而且还有特别嘉宾哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "33739e1382568bb3ac822f40c06ecb00b1fa3cb84a6729787f694da34c82b649", "ja": "今回お送りする朗読劇は、豪華2本立てですわ。\n『昏き星、遠い月』本編の続きになるお話と……。", "zh": "这次为大家带来的朗读剧，是由豪华的2部作品组成的。首先是《昏暗之星，遥远之月》正篇的后续故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "f1ee61c283b175b63f24d06bd691fec4669589f7b3b7e3c1cb835e0b79bfad43", "ja": "私たち夜想令嬢のメンバーが考えた、\nはっちゃけ特別番外編よ♪", "zh": "这是由我们夜想令嬢的成员们构思的，\n超嗨劲特别番外篇哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "adcd7f0b0374c96b31550fd71dd80076b3feb42c61d98ad29362a2595c3899f1", "ja": "どちらも違った魅力がありますから、\n楽しんでくださいね～。", "zh": "两边都有各自独特的魅力，请尽情享受吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_04_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "150cbbe9a3b5ce955005054e9d4eb0784d332bcb0df4f75652608e98209492e7", "ja": "それではさっそく、いってみよー♪", "zh": "那么马上开始吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
